note.p:
The BBTI suggests the following names: William Barnard (1774-1849) of 1 Lower Fitzroy St, Fitzroy Sq (1802). 18 London St, Fitzroy Sq. He was an engraver/etcher, 
    print seller trading 1798-1819; John George Barnard of 14 George's Ct, Clerkenwell. Water La, Fleet St. 57 Skinner St, Snow Hill. He was a printer rading 1800-1825; 
    and, Barnard of Barnard and Stevenson, 4 Mitre Court, Fleet St. He was a stationer trading 1802-5.
